  "diagram_alt": "",
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\dfrac{A}{2}$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\dfrac{A}{\\sqrt{3}}$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}A}{2}$",
      "image": ""
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\dfrac{A}{\\sqrt{2}}$",
      "image": ""
    }
  ],
  "answer": "D",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$U = \\dfrac{1}{2}kx^2$ and $K = \\dfrac{1}{2}k(A^2 - x^2)$. Setting them equal: $x^2 = A^2 - x^2 \\Rightarrow x = \\dfrac{A}{\\sqrt{2}}$.",
